==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈrɔ.lə(n)/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-rollen.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|nl|rol|len}}
* {{rhymes|nl|ɔlən|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|rollen}}, from {{der|nl|fro|roeler}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|ergative}} to [[roll]]
#: {{ux|nl|De bal '''rolt''' langzaam van de heuvel.|The ball '''rolls''' slowly down the hill.}}
# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[dupe]], cheat on
#: {{ux|nl|Ze werd opgelicht door een oplichter die haar wou '''rollen'''.|She was scammed by a fraudster who wanted to '''cheat on''' her.}}
# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[pickpocket]], to [[pinch]]
#: {{ux|nl|De zakkenroller '''rolde''' zijn zakken en nam zijn portemonnee mee.|The pickpocket '''picked''' his pockets and took his wallet.}}

